WEBVTT

00:02:28.980 --> 00:02:35.220
Passionate Bladers dueled in the
Beyblade tag-battle world championships.

00:02:35.220 --> 00:02:40.090
We, the BBA Revolution,
took home all the glory!

00:02:40.590 --> 00:02:45.580
Takao earned the title of three time world
champion and his popularity soared!

00:02:45.580 --> 00:02:51.920
He spent his days enjoying his
popularity with his partner, Daichi!

00:02:53.620 --> 00:02:58.280
Everyone's all over Takao...

00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:10.290
At this rate, I'll only ever
be known as his partner!

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:16.220
I've made up my mind. If I want to
become number one, I have to beat you!

00:03:20.560 --> 00:03:22.760
Which means I have to...

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:55.160
There's no going back!

00:03:55.160 --> 00:03:58.250
Yeah! A man's gotta do
what a man's gotta do.

00:03:58.250 --> 00:04:02.040
I'm gonna leave Takao
and go my own way!

00:04:03.040 --> 00:04:05.460
A journey of
training in solitude...

00:04:06.180 --> 00:04:07.970
The morning sun
stings my eyes.

00:04:07.970 --> 00:04:09.570
Hey, Daichi!

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:13.200
G'morning!
You're early as usual!

00:04:13.200 --> 00:04:15.210
Morning, mister!

00:04:17.260 --> 00:04:19.360
Take these!

00:04:20.640 --> 00:04:22.240
Thank you!

00:04:24.090 --> 00:04:26.000
Daichi!

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:28.180
Take one!

00:04:28.180 --> 00:04:30.040
Thanks, ma'am!

00:04:30.040 --> 00:04:31.640
They're fresh!

00:04:34.090 --> 00:04:38.460
Thank you! Thank you!
Thank you! Thank you!

00:04:47.180 --> 00:04:49.370
Thanks, all of you...

00:04:49.370 --> 00:04:52.260
The old guy from the grocery, the old lady from the bakery...

00:04:52.260 --> 00:04:54.050
And the lady from
the butcher's shop!

00:04:54.050 --> 00:04:58.130
But I can't stay here!

00:04:58.130 --> 00:05:02.300
See me off as I leave
on my manly journey!

00:05:04.760 --> 00:05:08.900
I should go see
Daitenji before I leave!

00:05:11.690 --> 00:05:14.860
This is not good...

00:05:15.450 --> 00:05:18.100
How could this happen?

00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:22.410
'Sup, Daitenji!

00:05:24.170 --> 00:05:28.250
Hello, Daichi. Can I help
you with anything?

00:05:28.250 --> 00:05:31.240
It's nothing important.

00:05:34.180 --> 00:05:36.850
Your office is awesome.

00:05:37.370 --> 00:05:40.240
Oh, well, not particularly...

00:05:40.880 --> 00:05:42.960
And this goes here, and...

00:05:42.960 --> 00:05:46.530
The truth is,
I'm going off to train.

00:05:46.530 --> 00:05:49.700
I won't be back until I'm
confident I can be number one.

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:53.600
So I figured I'd let you know, after all you've done for me.

00:05:53.600 --> 00:05:55.890
Oh, yes, thank you...

00:05:56.850 --> 00:05:59.280
I almost forgot to deal with
this important proposal...

00:05:59.280 --> 00:06:00.490
Pops...

00:06:03.780 --> 00:06:05.930
Yes, Daitenji speaking.

00:06:06.330 --> 00:06:09.650
Is that right?
I understand.

00:06:10.810 --> 00:06:16.660
Sorry, Daichi. I'm about to have a very important meeting, so...

00:06:16.660 --> 00:06:19.200
Okay.
I'll get going then.

00:06:20.480 --> 00:06:22.330
Old man Daitenji!

00:06:22.330 --> 00:06:23.640
Yes?

00:06:23.640 --> 00:06:26.490
Looks like you're busy,
but good luck!

00:06:29.260 --> 00:06:31.940
Good luck, huh?

00:06:35.800 --> 00:06:41.690
I gotta work hard too! I'm gonna make it over there in ten steps!

00:06:41.690 --> 00:06:44.520
One, two!

00:06:44.520 --> 00:06:46.120
Eight!

00:06:46.120 --> 00:06:48.020
Nine!

00:06:48.020 --> 00:06:49.100
Ten!

00:06:49.100 --> 00:06:51.680
Yes! A great success!

00:06:51.680 --> 00:06:55.460
Next! I'll walk a straight
line to that tree!

00:06:55.460 --> 00:06:56.920
Fall, and I die!

00:06:56.920 --> 00:06:58.930
Let's do it! Shoot!

00:06:59.850 --> 00:07:03.280
You can do it,
Gaia Dragoon Great!

00:07:03.280 --> 00:07:06.560
This is scary!
But it's fun too!

00:07:10.620 --> 00:07:11.770
Daichi!

00:07:17.650 --> 00:07:21.090
What's the big idea?!
I died!

00:07:21.090 --> 00:07:22.450
You died?

00:07:22.450 --> 00:07:24.690
I'm shark food!

00:07:24.690 --> 00:07:26.880
Why?!

00:07:26.880 --> 00:07:30.050
What?
I don't really get it...

00:07:30.050 --> 00:07:34.330
If you don't then stay out of my way!
You're always such a hag!

00:07:34.330 --> 00:07:35.580
Hag--

00:07:35.820 --> 00:07:37.930
I'm borrowing Daichi!

00:07:41.020 --> 00:07:43.850
Don't call me a hag!!

00:07:52.580 --> 00:07:53.960
I'm alive...

00:07:53.960 --> 00:07:58.360
How could this happen?!
The line is so long!

00:07:58.360 --> 00:08:00.760
I miscalculated!

00:08:00.760 --> 00:08:02.340
What's happening?

00:08:02.810 --> 00:08:05.890
Good question!
The truth is...

00:08:05.890 --> 00:08:07.290
Ta-da!

00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:11.450
This is Ming-Ming, an idol who's
really popular these days!

00:08:11.450 --> 00:08:12.680
So?

00:08:12.680 --> 00:08:17.370
The thing is, they're distributing
tickets for a fan meet next week...

00:08:17.370 --> 00:08:21.270
What's that have
to do with me?

00:08:21.730 --> 00:08:23.940
They're one per person!

00:08:24.570 --> 00:08:28.100
So you'll get one
and give it to me!

00:08:28.100 --> 00:08:33.890
So that means I can shake
hands with Ming-Ming twice!

00:08:33.890 --> 00:08:36.880
Sorry, man.
I don't have time for this.

00:08:36.880 --> 00:08:38.260
Oh, please!

00:08:38.260 --> 00:08:40.010
Ask someone else.

00:08:40.370 --> 00:08:43.040
Daichi, no! Wait!

00:08:46.930 --> 00:08:48.500
I can't just sit here!

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:53.760
If I calculate the wait time based on the length of the line and number of people lined up...

00:08:53.760 --> 00:08:57.130
Oh no! I have to make
sure I get at least one!

00:08:57.960 --> 00:09:01.380
Everyone's getting
in my way today...

00:09:01.380 --> 00:09:03.820
I can't train like this!

00:09:03.820 --> 00:09:08.130
I need to go
somewhere further away!

00:09:14.000 --> 00:09:16.990
But before that,
it's chow time!

00:09:18.080 --> 00:09:20.380
Thanks to all the
old guys and ladies.

00:09:20.380 --> 00:09:22.170
Time to ea--

00:09:26.040 --> 00:09:27.860
Hey, my bread!

00:09:33.680 --> 00:09:35.970
A cat and a...
Monkey?

00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:38.740
Get back here! Hey!

00:09:38.930 --> 00:09:40.840
Why you...

00:09:43.880 --> 00:09:46.320
Get back here!

00:09:48.380 --> 00:09:50.620
Nowhere to run!

00:09:57.780 --> 00:10:00.850
Darn, where'd it go?

00:10:00.850 --> 00:10:02.920
Got away...

00:10:07.850 --> 00:10:09.610
I finally found you.

00:10:09.610 --> 00:10:13.250
Time to gimme
back my lunch.

00:10:13.780 --> 00:10:15.760
Gotcha!

00:10:18.400 --> 00:10:22.970
Oh, I see now. You stole my
bread to feed these little guys.

00:10:24.690 --> 00:10:26.400
Hey, you!

00:10:28.410 --> 00:10:31.540
Okay, fine.
I'll give up on the bread.

00:10:31.540 --> 00:10:32.650
And...

00:10:34.970 --> 00:10:37.700
I'll give you all of this!

00:10:37.700 --> 00:10:40.610
Don't forget this favor!

00:10:42.600 --> 00:10:46.370
I've got a journey to
get back to. See ya.

00:10:46.370 --> 00:10:47.410
Later!

00:11:01.970 --> 00:11:03.880
A helper...

00:11:11.220 --> 00:11:14.160
I wasted a lot of time!

00:11:15.020 --> 00:11:18.640
But I did a good thing.
I'm a good guy!

00:11:18.640 --> 00:11:23.410
I got pretty far after
chasing that cat.

00:11:25.930 --> 00:11:28.240
Now this is what
I call training!

00:11:30.810 --> 00:11:32.240
That's it!

00:11:42.370 --> 00:11:46.410
I'll be able to get even
further away on this!

00:11:46.410 --> 00:11:49.660
My training has
finally begun!

00:11:50.810 --> 00:11:54.280
I'm super excited!

00:11:56.070 --> 00:12:03.910
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade G-Revolution"

00:12:07.400 --> 00:12:09.050
Training...

00:12:25.920 --> 00:12:29.810
Where the heck did I
go while I was asleep?

00:12:29.810 --> 00:12:32.260
I've never seen anything
like this before!

00:12:32.540 --> 00:12:35.010
You're the only
thing that's familiar!

00:12:38.120 --> 00:12:41.890
This is the choice I made.

00:12:41.890 --> 00:12:45.450
Let's put in some hard
work, Gaia Dragoon!

00:12:45.720 --> 00:12:48.860
Time to train!

00:12:53.460 --> 00:12:56.500
Where should I go?

00:13:04.970 --> 00:13:07.640
I don't know
anyone around here...

00:13:07.640 --> 00:13:09.960
And I'm hungry...

00:13:09.960 --> 00:13:13.820
Maybe I should have left a
little food for myself...

00:13:13.820 --> 00:13:16.170
What am I supposed to do?

00:13:16.170 --> 00:13:17.700
Hello!

00:13:23.400 --> 00:13:27.020
Hi, Daichi! What a
coincidence, meeting you here!

00:13:27.020 --> 00:13:28.780
Hey there, Daichi.

00:13:28.780 --> 00:13:30.820
Oh, it's just Max...

00:13:30.820 --> 00:13:32.560
Which means this is--

00:13:32.560 --> 00:13:37.680
I made it all the
way to America!

00:13:37.680 --> 00:13:39.330
Is something wrong?

00:13:39.860 --> 00:13:42.680
What are you doing out
here by yourself, Daichi?

00:13:42.680 --> 00:13:44.930
You're not with Takao!

00:13:45.250 --> 00:13:46.560
Takao...?

00:13:47.370 --> 00:13:48.940
Takao...

00:13:48.940 --> 00:13:51.170
Never heard of 'im.

00:13:51.170 --> 00:13:55.090
There's no rule saying I
have to be with him 24/7.

00:13:55.090 --> 00:13:58.000
Takao is Takao.
And me is me!

00:13:59.180 --> 00:14:01.480
I bet they had another fight.

00:14:01.480 --> 00:14:02.500
I see.

00:14:02.500 --> 00:14:07.320
That's it! Would you like to eat
dinner at our house, Daichi?

00:14:08.610 --> 00:14:09.690
Are you sure?

00:14:09.690 --> 00:14:12.120
Of course!
Right, daddy?

00:14:12.120 --> 00:14:14.800
You're always
welcome, Daichi!

00:14:14.800 --> 00:14:16.820
I'll make some good food!

00:14:16.820 --> 00:14:18.080
Really?!

00:14:18.080 --> 00:14:20.450
Alright!

00:14:20.450 --> 00:14:23.240
Perfect timing! I'm starving!

00:14:23.240 --> 00:14:25.890
Nothing better than a great rival!

00:14:25.890 --> 00:14:28.920
Yeah! Let's get moving!

00:14:28.920 --> 00:14:33.010
I'm sure the change of pace
will improve Daichi's mood.

00:14:33.010 --> 00:14:34.160
Sure.

00:14:34.160 --> 00:14:37.450
Max!
Which way's your house?!

00:14:49.760 --> 00:14:52.100
This meat looks awesome!

00:14:52.100 --> 00:14:54.340
America rules!

00:14:56.250 --> 00:14:59.280
Eat as much as you like!

00:14:59.280 --> 00:15:01.610
Thanks, daddy!

00:15:01.610 --> 00:15:03.090
Daddy...

00:15:03.440 --> 00:15:05.370
I mean, you're daddy right?

00:15:05.370 --> 00:15:07.860
Don't sweat the small stuff.

00:15:07.860 --> 00:15:11.180
Time to eat!

00:15:11.180 --> 00:15:14.210
So good!
Max, this is awesome!

00:15:14.210 --> 00:15:15.920
It tastes so American!

00:15:15.920 --> 00:15:20.640
That's good to hear!
But you're so hasty, Daichi!

00:15:20.640 --> 00:15:21.880
Here!

00:15:24.720 --> 00:15:27.320
What are you
doing to my steak?!

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:29.450
This'll make it
100 times tastier!

00:15:29.450 --> 00:15:32.570
No way!
Mind your own business!

00:15:32.570 --> 00:15:34.090
My own business?

00:15:34.090 --> 00:15:37.180
Are you saying you
don't like our food?!

00:15:37.180 --> 00:15:42.170
Yeah! There's no way steak tastes good
with all this crummy mayonnaise all over it!

00:15:42.170 --> 00:15:44.140
Crummy mayonnaise?

00:15:44.940 --> 00:15:47.780
Don't be so
unreasonable, Daichi!

00:15:48.100 --> 00:15:49.100
Well...

00:15:50.600 --> 00:15:53.260
It's our house special!

00:15:53.260 --> 00:15:55.100
Cut it out!

00:15:55.900 --> 00:15:57.370
Daichi...

00:15:57.370 --> 00:16:00.040
I had no idea you were
such a picky eater, Daichi.

00:16:00.040 --> 00:16:02.010
Picky?!

00:16:02.010 --> 00:16:05.260
Just lemme eat my
food the way I want!

00:16:06.260 --> 00:16:08.650
That's the definition
of being picky!

00:16:08.650 --> 00:16:13.250
I feel sorry for Takao if he has to
put up with your selfish attitude!

00:16:13.250 --> 00:16:16.340
What?!
Leave Takao out of this!

00:16:16.340 --> 00:16:19.760
I'm not selfish,
you're just pushy!

00:16:19.760 --> 00:16:21.040
Pushy?!

00:16:22.840 --> 00:16:27.340
I can't take this sitting down.

00:16:27.340 --> 00:16:29.860
What are you
gonna do about it?

00:16:29.860 --> 00:16:31.500
It means...

00:16:31.730 --> 00:16:33.800
--We'll Beybattle!

00:16:36.220 --> 00:16:38.900
Last chance for
apologies, Daichi.

00:16:38.900 --> 00:16:41.080
I'll give you time!

00:16:41.260 --> 00:16:44.090
Right back at you!

00:16:47.050 --> 00:16:48.770
This is a one round match.

00:16:48.770 --> 00:16:51.760
Win or lose, no hard
feelings. Understood?

00:16:51.760 --> 00:16:53.740
Now! Ready...

00:16:53.740 --> 00:16:56.560
Three! Two! One!

00:16:56.560 --> 00:16:58.380
--Go, Shoot!

00:16:58.380 --> 00:17:00.650
Go, Gaia Dragoon!

00:17:00.650 --> 00:17:03.920
Show this pushy guy
what we're made of!

00:17:03.920 --> 00:17:07.170
Stop calling me
that, blockhead!

00:17:33.140 --> 00:17:35.880
Max isn't all defense!

00:17:35.880 --> 00:17:38.320
He's got the power
to back it up!

00:17:38.320 --> 00:17:42.950
Daichi's as good as ever--
I'll need stronger attacks if I want to...

00:17:51.460 --> 00:17:56.040
He's in position.
I can't attack like this!

00:17:56.260 --> 00:17:57.360
But...

00:17:57.360 --> 00:17:58.250
Here it comes!

00:17:58.250 --> 00:18:01.420
As a man I
can't back down!

00:18:01.420 --> 00:18:04.370
Go, Gaia Dragoon!

00:18:05.570 --> 00:18:07.740
Here he comes, Draciel!

00:18:11.690 --> 00:18:15.280
You'll need more than that
to make my Draciel budge!

00:18:15.280 --> 00:18:17.890
I'm still warming up!

00:18:20.620 --> 00:18:23.160
It's hard to
knock him out...

00:18:23.160 --> 00:18:26.420
But I'm the world champion!

00:18:26.420 --> 00:18:30.080
I can't lose to
someone Takao beat!

00:18:30.520 --> 00:18:32.940
I can't lose!

00:18:35.570 --> 00:18:37.240
He's so powerful!

00:18:37.240 --> 00:18:40.970
Wake up!
I'm gonna finish this now!

00:18:45.130 --> 00:18:47.810
Don't underestimate me!

00:18:50.940 --> 00:18:54.400
Great Cutter!

00:19:02.900 --> 00:19:07.010
Gravity Control!!

00:19:14.090 --> 00:19:16.130
No! I can't cut it!

00:19:18.540 --> 00:19:19.730
What?!

00:19:32.000 --> 00:19:33.480
Max wins!

00:19:33.800 --> 00:19:37.340
That was close.
I just barely won.

00:19:38.850 --> 00:19:41.450
No... I lost...

00:19:41.450 --> 00:19:44.290
But I'm the world champion,
just like Takao is...

00:19:44.290 --> 00:19:45.700
I'm dead.

00:19:47.610 --> 00:19:50.240
Do you understand now, Daichi?

00:19:50.240 --> 00:19:53.500
Now that you lost, you'll
have to listen to me!

00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:55.400
What were we fighting over?

00:19:55.400 --> 00:19:56.290
Beats me.

00:19:56.290 --> 00:19:58.140
Dang! I lost!

00:19:58.140 --> 00:20:01.730
I thought I was
stronger than Takao!

00:20:01.730 --> 00:20:07.250
I wanted to train, beat Takao,
and become the real champion!

00:20:07.250 --> 00:20:09.180
But that ain't how
it went down!

00:20:10.610 --> 00:20:13.330
Takao's not the
only strong one.

00:20:13.780 --> 00:20:15.420
Daichi...

00:20:15.420 --> 00:20:19.010
I got it! I'm going to train
here from now on.

00:20:22.460 --> 00:20:26.160
Wow! It's all bubbly!

00:20:27.360 --> 00:20:29.460
'Stache!

00:20:34.450 --> 00:20:37.280
Nothing like milk
after a bath!

00:20:48.160 --> 00:20:51.020
How did this happen?

00:20:58.300 --> 00:21:01.580
It's so quiet without Daichi...

00:21:05.100 --> 00:21:10.400
I understand how you feel.
Wanting to improve yourself...

00:21:10.400 --> 00:21:13.220
I wonder where
he is right now?

00:21:13.220 --> 00:21:18.140
I bet he's
somewhere far away...

00:21:30.370 --> 00:21:33.090
Time to train!

00:22:55.850 --> 00:22:58.090
The BBA is gone?!

00:22:58.090 --> 00:23:01.420
What you mean someone bought it out, Chairman Daitenji?!

00:23:01.420 --> 00:23:04.890
Oh no! Chairman Daitenji
has gone missing!

00:23:04.890 --> 00:23:08.200
Hey Takao, is it true that Beyblade
is getting a pro league?

00:23:08.200 --> 00:23:12.210
What's BEGA? What are they
gonna do with the BBA HQ?

00:23:12.210 --> 00:23:16.020
Dang, it's one thing after another!
I just don't get it!!

00:23:16.020 --> 00:23:18.500
What are we supposed
to do now?!

00:23:18.940 --> 00:23:22.370
Either way, Ming-Ming's
as cute as a button!
